  DisplayName: Violet Nebula
  Subtitle: Ionized gas cloud - low visibility
  Briefing: 'Sensors are useless in the nebula. The Swarm breeds here.

    Expect
    every enemy type at once, elite escorts, and their fastest ace: the Reaper Wing.

    The
    Hive Queen must not leave this cloud.'
  Objectives: '- Break through the nebula

    - Shoot down the Reaper Wing

    -
    Kill the Hive Queen'
